Commit: ComputerWizzy-Icon <computerwizzy100@gmail.com>

    Initial commit: ArcFlow — USDC-native dashboard on Arc
    
    Production-ready Next.js/TypeScript reference app for Circle Arc App Kit.
    
    Features:
    - Swap: same-chain stablecoin swaps on Arc with live quotes & slippage control
    - Bridge: cross-chain native USDC via Circle CCTP (fast/standard) with step tracking
    - Send: USDC/EURC/USDT transfers with pre-sign fee estimates
    - Unified Balance: pooled USDC across chains via Circle Gateway (deposit/spend)
    - Developer Playground: live, runnable App Kit recipes with code + responses
    - Landing page: Arc intro, feature grid, supported chains
    
    Core: lib/arc (kit singleton, chain/token registries, formatting, errors),
    wagmi to App Kit viem adapter bridge, TanStack Query feature hooks.
    
    Verified: tsc --noEmit clean, eslint clean, next build (9 static routes).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

